WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.900
A real job from this repo, replayed and sped up

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
You ask your agent for /desk:design a launch card for LinkedIn

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.300
The Design Manager staffs it. Three UI Designer agents make three roughs

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.000
The roughs land on the review board. The Art Director picks one and says why

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.800
A cheap model polishes, proof checks the pixels, the Creative Director scores it

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.600
8.4 is under the bar of 8.5, so it goes round again

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.400
8.5, but originality is still under 8. One more round

8
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.400
Signed off at 8.9, every axis at 8 or above

9
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.400
The files are in .desk/out/&lt;job&gt;/, linked from the board

10
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:49.600
What each desk did, and what it cost at list price
